{"id":"olla","lemma":"olla","pos":"noun","rank":4176,"glosses":["pot, pan; kettle (vessel used for cooking food)","stew (dish cooked by stewing)","pool, whirlpool"],"ipa":"/ˈoʝa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ollas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/00/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-olla.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Se te ha ido la olla?","en":"Have you gone nuts?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459168","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"away with the fairies"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La olla está hirviendo.","en":"The pot is boiling over.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to boil","l":"hervir"}]},{"text":"Friega las ollas y las sartenes.","en":"Clean the pots and pans.","words":[{"g":"to wash","l":"fregar"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"frying pan","l":"sartén"}]},{"text":"Tal vez se me esté yendo la olla.","en":"Maybe I'm losing my mind.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611871","words":[null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"maybe, perhaps"]]},{"text":"Se les va la olla.","en":"They're insane.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441229","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"them"},{"g":"okay"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}